Z||000005||Fformula88||11-02-2001||02:00 PM||||I have rarely run into a Fiero that had a lot of stuff left on it at a yard.  Usually, the yards have one, maybe two but thats a lot.  I think they get stripped so fast that they don't keep them long.  I saw one this past summer that a couple interior bits aleft, and that was about it.  No kidding, it was stripped to the frame both front and rear, including suspension (and it was an 84, not an 88!)!!||||reg||1
